","title":"Re: About 魔法熟练度","time":778674075,"poster":"Kalin",]),(["id":12,"title":"how to type chinese","body":"
    Hmm ..... How to type Chinese ??

    All u need just moving Ur fingers around the keyboard. :P

    OK , let's check it.

     1st. check If ur ET3 using BIG-5 code now.
     2nd. If U link from UNIX(HP or SUN), stty pass8.
          If U link from VMS(Vax)  ,  set terminal/eight_bit

     3rd. If u done all above and still can't ...... change where ur system..

                                  Indra.
